- !join to join
- !leave to leave
- after join any text with [WASD directions] chained together will be parsed as movement
- eg. wwwaxxx <- moves up three times then left

Heat Extension:
Verify your heat extension then refresh the browser
- click once to join
- click more to path to a cell

Catch the Fins! (to be implemented)"
